OL,3,CYouTuber and rapper Yung Filly found
OL,4,Cnot guilty of raping woman in Australia
OL,6,FBritish rapper and social media
OL,7,Finfluencer Yung Filly has been found
OL,8,Fnot guilty of raping a woman in an
OL,9,FAustralian hotel room.
OL,11,FThe 30-year-old, whose real name is
OL,12,FAndres Felipe Valencia Barrientos,
OL,13,Fpleaded not guilty to all charges at
OL,14,Fthe District Court of Western
OL,15,FAustralia.
OL,17,FHe was, however, found guilty of two
OL,18,Fcounts of assault occasioning bodily
OL,19,Fharm, relating to incidents in which
OL,20,Fhe bit the woman's neck and breast.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
