OL,3,CYouTuber and rapper Yung Filly found
OL,4,Cnot guilty of raping woman in Australia
OL,6,FFollowing an eight-day trial in Perth,
OL,7,Fa jury found Barrientos not guilty of
OL,8,Fthree counts of sexual penetration
OL,9,Fwithout consent, an assault charge
OL,10,Frelating to an alleged slap and a
OL,11,Fchoking charge.
OL,13,FProsecutors had alleged that
OL,14,FBarrientos assaulted a 20-year-old
OL,15,Fwoman in his hotel room while he was
OL,16,Ftouring Australia in September 2024.
OL,18,FJurors were unable to reach verdicts
OL,19,Fon three additional counts of sexual
OL,20,Fpenetration without consent.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
