OL,3,CYouTuber and rapper Yung Filly found
OL,4,Cnot guilty of raping woman in Australia
OL,6,FWestern Australia's courts confirmed
OL,7,Fthe verdict was returned on Friday
OL,8,Fmorning local time, following jury
OL,9,Fdeliberations that began on Wednesday
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,12,FProsecutor Danielle Clarke told the
OL,13,Fcourt Barrientos was an "entitled man"
OL,14,Fwith a "moderate degree of fame" who
OL,15,Fhad been sexually violent toward an
OL,16,F"impressionable" young woman.
OL,18,F"She meant nothing to him," Clarke
OL,19,Ftold the court in her closing
OL,20,Farguments.
