OL,3,CYouTuber and rapper Yung Filly found
OL,4,Cnot guilty of raping woman in Australia
OL,6,F"What could have been and should have
OL,7,Fbeen consensual sex quickly escalated
OL,8,Finto sexual violence and a non-
OL,9,Fconsensual nightmare," she added.
OL,11,FDefence lawyer David Edwardson replied
OL,12,Fthat the accuser's "evidence is
OL,13,Friddled with inconsistencies,
OL,14,Fembellishments and outright lies."
OL,16,FBarrientos has appeared on several BBC
OL,17,Fshows and is known for collaborating
OL,18,Fwith the YouTube collective Beta Squad.
